cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you find this list useful, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Awesome MLLM Unlearning: A Curated List of Machine Unlearning for Multimodal Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  A curated list of papers, benchmarks, and resources on machine unlearning
  for multimodal large language models (MLLMs) and vision-language models
  (VLMs), covering benchmarks, unlearning methods, safety and hallucination
  unlearning, robustness and attack evaluations, CLIP-style models, and
  multimodal models beyond vision.
type: software
authors:
